   Dendauw, Edouard; Haffen, Emmanuel; Bennabi, Djamila; Servant, Mathieu, Univ Franche Comte, Inst Natl Sante \& Rech Med, Lab Rech Integrat Neurosci \& Psychol Cognit, Besancon, France.
